\title{Mango Markets (2022)}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-10-09}

\p{
    Finally, Mango Markets, a Solana-based DEX, was attacked in October 2022 for approximately 116
    million USD in contract assets. The attack consisted of a complicated and subtle trading
    strategy
    which only a sophisticated trader would be able to see and exploit. [CoinDesk
    reported](https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2022/10/12/how-market-manipulation-led-to-a-100m-exploit-on-solana-defi-exchange-mango)
    that the
    attacker did everything within the parameters of the platform’s design. Avraham Eisenberg, [the
    attacker](https://solscan.io/account/CQvKSNnYtPTZfQRQ5jkHq8q2swJyRsdQLcFcj3EmKFfX),
    [wrote](https://x.com/avi_eisen/status/1581326199682265088):
}

\p{
    \em{
        "I believe all of our actions were legal open market actions, using the protocol as
        designed, even
        if the development team did not fully anticipate all the consequences of setting parameters
        the
        way they are."
    } [(link)](https://x.com/avi_eisen/status/1581326199682265088)
}